    {
      "id": "4fc4cbb2-24f1-4f89-8610-ca3ce7853eeb",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 1,
      "data": {
        "title": "Token bucket em Redis (atômico)"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "e312804f-d049-4754-a17b-3a879cc0fcee",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "lua",
            "code": "-- Lua script em Redis — atômico\n-- KEYS[1] = bucket key\n-- ARGV[1] = capacity, ARGV[2] = refill_rate, ARGV[3] = now_ms\nlocal capacity = tonumber(ARGV[1])\nlocal refill   = tonumber(ARGV[2])\nlocal now      = tonumber(ARGV[3])\n\nlocal data = redis.call('HMGET', KEYS[1], 'tokens', 'last')\nlocal tokens = tonumber(data[1]) or capacity\nlocal last   = tonumber(data[2]) or now\n\n-- Refill\nlocal elapsed = (now - last) / 1000\ntokens = math.min(capacity, tokens + elapsed * refill)\n\nif tokens < 1 then\n  redis.call('HMSET', KEYS[1], 'tokens', tokens, 'last', now)\n  return {0, math.ceil((1 - tokens) / refill)}  -- rejeita, Retry-After\nend\n\nredis.call('HMSET', KEYS[1], 'tokens', tokens - 1, 'last', now)\nreturn {1, 0}  -- permite"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "f068f474-35c1-4d8d-803d-b6d7c948dab3",
          "type": "callout",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "variant": "info",
            "title": "",
            "content": "Redis + Lua = atomicidade barata. Alternativas: , , ."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "175df182-1eb2-4fa4-921c-072d07ee39ed",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 2,
      "data": {
        "title": "Headers padronizados"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "86be944a-fb94-45e5-80e3-4e3600339d4e",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "http",
            "code": "HTTP/1.1 429 Too Many Requests\nRateLimit-Limit: 100\nRateLimit-Remaining: 0\nRateLimit-Reset: 60\nRetry-After: 60\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\"error\":\"rate_limit_exceeded\",\"retry_after_s\":60}"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "702ff66d-b957-40b6-bcf2-5673bb36fa04",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " Draft IETF "
              },
              {
                "text": "draft-ietf-httpapi-ratelimit-headers",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": " padroniza "
              },
              {
                "text": "RateLimit-*",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": ". Inclua em toda resposta (não só 429) pra cliente saber quanto tem. "
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "00354af9-6bf1-4bc7-8904-513894d03ed5",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 3,
      "data": {
        "title": "Fairness multi-tenant"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "16fec718-d405-43bb-8267-76ca0ab52321",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " Rate limit global (1000 req/s pra toda a API) permite que um cliente agressivo afame os outros. Solução: "
              },
              {
                "text": "bucket por tenant",
                "bold": true
              },
              {
                "text": " (API key, user, IP). Key: "
              },
              {
                "text": "ratelimit:{tenantId}",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": ". "
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "8763ee03-30fa-4dc9-93fd-8f1292e764f3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " Quota (diária/mensal) é limite de volume, não de taxa. Ex: plano free = 10k req/dia. Rate limit (req/s) ataca burst; quota ataca uso total. "
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
